{"id":"a1aa1a83a0327c18","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-sequent-identity.md","title":"Sequent Identity","display":"df-sequent-identity — Sequent Identity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-sequent-identity","aliases":["72-df-sequent-identity"],"display":"df-sequent-identity — Sequent Identity","depends_on":["[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]","[[72-df-sequent-axiom]]","[[72-df-weakening]]","[[72-df-exchange]]","[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","[[72-df-sequent-rule]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §§1.2.1–1.2.2; print10–12/PDF22–24; explicit local encoding","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-sequent-identity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-sequent-identity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sequent-identity — Sequent Identity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b6882ca0a0cd075f\" href=\"?note=b6882ca0a0cd075f\" title=\"72-df-sequent-axiom\">72-df-sequent-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"db558ef17df6892e\" href=\"?note=db558ef17df6892e\" title=\"72-df-weakening\">72-df-weakening</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e18594e1037dd7cd\" href=\"?note=e18594e1037dd7cd\" title=\"72-df-exchange\">72-df-exchange</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" href=\"?note=d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" title=\"72-df-sequent-rule\">72-df-sequent-rule</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §§1.2.1–1.2.2; print10–12/PDF22–24; explicit local encoding"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\">\\(\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a> 的五分量签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\">\\(X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Sigma\">\\(X_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>有限序列以自然数为定义域，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A\\rangle=\\{\\langle0,A\\rangle\\}\">\\(\\langle A\\rangle=\\{\\langle0,A\\rangle\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,A\">\\(\\Gamma,A\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\frown\\langle A\\rangle\">\\(\\Gamma\\frown\\langle A\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\Gamma\">\\(A,\\Gamma\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma\">\\(\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma\\)</span>。多个逗号按次序串接。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\">\\(\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a> 的语法有序对。</li>\n<li>本文件的规则名均指推理实例关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UInf}(s,t)=\\langle\\langle s\\rangle,t\\rangle\">\\(\\operatorname{UInf}(s,t)=\\langle\\langle s\\rangle,t\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BInf}(s,t,u)=\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,u\\rangle\">\\(\\operatorname{BInf}(s,t,u)=\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,u\\rangle\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" href=\"?note=d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" title=\"72-df-sequent-rule\">72-df-sequent-rule</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathsf{ctx}}:=\\{\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma A,\\Delta:\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,A\\in X_\\Sigma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathsf{ctx}}:=\\{\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma A,\\Delta:\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,A\\in X_\\Sigma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>上下文也在集合构造中量化，修复旧式把Γ、Δ留作任意固定外参而误称全部初始式。由裸恒等式经弱化和交换得到。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"b6882ca0a0cd075f",